## 🧠 Imagine grid

Take `n = 5`

Your loops create something like this:

```
i ↓ , j →
      1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9
i=1   . . . . . . . . .
i=2   . . . . . . . . .
i=3   . . . . . . . . .
i=4   . . . . . . . . .
i=5   . . . . . . . . .
```

Each position = `(i, j)`

