## 🔥 Now focus on this condition

### 👉 `j == n - i + 1`

Let’s plug values:

| i | j = n-i+1 | position |
| - | --------- | -------- |
| 1 | 5         | (1,5)    |
| 2 | 4         | (2,4)    |
| 3 | 3         | (3,3)    |
| 4 | 2         | (4,2)    |
| 5 | 1         | (5,1)    |

