## 🧠 Core truth

Bro… diagonal not magic

It’s just:

```text
Row changes + Column changes = line
```

* if j decreases → left diagonal
* if j increases → right diagonal

---

## 🪨 Simple brain rule

```text
j = constant ± i  → diagonal
```

